   "type": "svg",
   "title": "Die Säulen eines totalitären Regimes",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect width=\"640\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\"/>\n<polygon points=\"320,20 610,90 30,90\" fill=\"#475569\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">TOTALITÄRER STAAT</text>\n<rect x=\"45\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#ef4444\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"140\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#f97316\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"235\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#eab308\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"330\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#22c55e\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"425\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<rect x=\"520\" y=\"95\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\" fill=\"#a855f7\" stroke=\"#0f172a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Einheits-</text>\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">partei</text>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Führer-</text>\n<text x=\"180\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">kult</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Propaganda</text>\n<text x=\"370\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Polizei</text>\n<text x=\"370\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">und Terror</text>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Kontrolle</text>\n<text x=\"465\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">der Jugend</text>\n<text x=\"560\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Kontrolle</text>\n<text x=\"560\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\">Wirtschaft</text>\n<rect x=\"30\" y=\"250\" width=\"580\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fde68a\">IDEOLOGIE + ein „FEIND“, der bekämpft wird</text>\n</svg>",
   "caption": "Alle Säulen ruhen auf einer Ideologie, die alles erklären will, und auf einem Feind (im Inneren oder Äußeren), dem die Schuld an den Problemen gegeben wird."
